{"name": "Break the Empire", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Be the villain! This game will tickle that <u>action-magic-fantasy-nerve</u>, and if you are looking for hours of entertainment: <u>give this game a try</u>! </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>A fast-paced, yet tactical, action-roguelite!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975180/extras/297d0528f3691a334879e71feeeb93df.poster.avif?t=1787033207\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975180/extras/297d0528f3691a334879e71feeeb93df.webm?t=1787033207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975180/extras/297d0528f3691a334879e71feeeb93df.mp4?t=1787033207\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Storm castles with hordes of undead!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975180/extras/1bc124adc9964c9cfb329ad99a14deaa.poster.avif?t=1787033207\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975180/extras/1bc124adc9964c9cfb329ad99a14deaa.webm?t=1787033207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975180/extras/1bc124adc9964c9cfb329ad99a14deaa.mp4?t=1787033207\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>...or turn the Empire against itself!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975180/extras/846796efc1ad92985170c002e01c766c.poster.avif?t=1787033207\" width=\"650\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975180/extras/846796efc1ad92985170c002e01c766c.webm?t=1787033207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975180/extras/846796efc1ad92985170c002e01c766c.mp4?t=1787033207\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>...or just smash it all with brute force!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975180/extras/038e7df85676eefe0b0cce8e21d26cf1.poster.avif?t=1787033207\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975180/extras/038e7df85676eefe0b0cce8e21d26cf1.webm?t=1787033207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975180/extras/038e7df85676eefe0b0cce8e21d26cf1.mp4?t=1787033207\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Customize your playstyle:</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975180/extras/7d337f31bbc4171c65c287228bd2aab5.poster.avif?t=1787033207\" width=\"650\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975180/extras/7d337f31bbc4171c65c287228bd2aab5.webm?t=1787033207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975180/extras/7d337f31bbc4171c65c287228bd2aab5.mp4?t=1787033207\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Detailed features:</strong></u> (so far, as more will be added)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>8 playable characters</strong>, each very different from the next. Each has six unique spells, six unique passive skills, and there are 12 base skills anyone can choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Terrain matters</strong>: Fires spread rapidly on grass, water can be frozen, pits can be fallen into.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wild skill combinations</strong>, allowing for completely unique playthroughs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique items with randomized qualities</strong>, exponentially adding combos and variety to the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>70 Steam Achievements</strong>, which offers varied meta-progression!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each playthrough is a mini-campaign</strong>, starting at a small village and ending in the halls of the emperor's castle. The path will vary, taking you through magical glades, towns, fortresses, or dwarven mines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New game mode</strong>: Last Stand - Survive as long as you can during relentless attacks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>11 unique bosses!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dozens of enemies</strong>, each with variable stats, traits and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-pixeled coziness</strong>, details, and indie warmth!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique and adventurous <strong>original soundtrack.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hours of fun at a cheap price!</strong></p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Fight your way to the capital and slay the emperor! Choose from a variety of characters with unique spells and skills! Featuring permadeath, interactable terrain, distinct builds, wild combos, and endless replayability.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975180/85ec2cb371f5e11d06af5615fbdf134eeaf7930c/header.jpg?t=1787033207", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Action RPG", "Action Roguelike", "2D", "Minimalist", "Pixel Graphics"], "developers": "Edym Pixels", "publishers": "Edym Pixels", "release_date": "Mar 26, 2025", "price": "$4.99", "appid": "2975180", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "26 March 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/kW6DSJEfxIk", "first_seen": 1742947200.0, "review_rank": 1756}